(Bug #14 regression, shape B: plain period-separated `but if` branches with
no `On error` involved. Each branch's own trailing period must not close the
whole chain, or later branches (and their variables) are silently lost.)

a list called fs is ["proc", "sysfs", "other"].
For each f in fs,
  Continue,
    but if f is equal to "proc" print "did proc".
    but if f is equal to "sysfs" print "did sysfs".

Print "done".
